# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  字体：随程序附带的三套字体 + 系统字体（可在「天机 · 界面外观」里切换）
# [EN] Fonts: three bundled families + system fonts (switchable in "Tianji · UI appearance")
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 用户 2026-10-06：「这个程序的字体感觉不好看，你有更好看的字体和字号大小
# 优化吗？」→ 当时选了**霞鹜文楷**。
# 用户 2026-10-11：「运行窗口用的字体不太好，**有些字比如门的写的跟普通写法
# 不同**」→ 换成**思源宋体**做默认，霞鹜文楷降为可选项（详见下面 `BUNDLED_FONTS`
# 的说明）。同一次还要求「全局设置里界面部分加上**字体设置和字号**等设置」。
# [EN] User 2026-10-06: "this program's font doesn't look good, do you have a better-looking font and
# [EN] size optimization?" -> **LXGW WenKai** was chosen then.
# [EN] User 2026-10-11: "the font in the run window isn't great, **some characters like 门 are written
# [EN] differently from the normal form**" -> switched the default to **Noto Serif SC**, demoting LXGW
# [EN] WenKai to an option (see `BUNDLED_FONTS` below). The same request also asked to "add **font and
# [EN] font-size** settings to the UI section of global settings".
# 授权口径（**这条决定"能不能随程序发"**）：
#   · 随附的三套都是 **SIL OFL 1.1** —— 免费、可商用、可随程序分发/嵌入，没有商业风险；
#   · 系统的宋体 / 微软雅黑 / 苹方等是操作系统自带的，**不许**跟着程序发给别人，
#     所以它们只能作为"本机装了才列出"的可选项（`SYSTEM_FONTS`）。
# [EN] Licensing (this decides "can it be shipped with the program"):
# [EN] · All three bundled ones are **SIL OFL 1.1** -- free, commercial use allowed, may be
# [EN] distributed/embedded with the program, no commercial risk;
# [EN] · The system's SimSun / Microsoft YaHei / PingFang etc. ship with the OS and **must not** be
# [EN] redistributed with the program, so they can only be options "listed when installed locally"
# [EN] (`SYSTEM_FONTS`).
# ⚠ **找不到字体文件时一律退回系统字体，绝不因为少一个 .ttf/.otf 就崩**
#   （用户可以自己把 `NotoSerifSC-Regular.otf` 丢进 `assets/fonts/`；
#    下载脚本：`developers/fetch_font2.py`）。
# [EN] ⚠ **When the font file is not found, always fall back to the system font, never crash just
# [EN] because a .ttf/.otf is missing**
# [EN] (users can drop `NotoSerifSC-Regular.otf` into `assets/fonts/` themselves; download script:
# [EN] `developers/fetch_font2.py`).
FONT_DIR = APP_DIR / 'assets' / 'fonts'
#: 兼容旧名字（`tools/verify_font.py` 等仍按这两个名字问"随附的默认字体是哪一份"）。
#: 它们现在指向**默认的随附字体**（= 思源宋体），不再是霞鹜文楷。
# [EN] Backward-compatible names (`tools/verify_font.py` etc. still ask these two for "which bundled
# [EN] font is the default"). They now point at the **default bundled font** (= Noto Serif SC), no
# [EN] longer LXGW WenKai.
FONT_FAMILY = 'NWS Noto Serif SC'
FONT_REGULAR = 'NotoSerifSC-Regular.otf'

# 开始菜单八项的**彩色图标**（位图）。用户 2026-10-10：「你帮我绘制或者去网上
# 找之前那种彩色图标 现在不好看 如果是网上找则请避免版权问题」。
# 素材 = 微软 Fluent Emoji（**MIT**，可商用可再分发）→ 见
# `assets/images/menu_icons/README.md`（出处、许可、槽位对照、怎么重建都在那里）。
# 槽位名（`<槽位>.png` / `<槽位>_dim.png`）：open_book / books / play / puzzle /
# gear / brush / rewind / door。生成脚本：`developers/make_menu_icons.py`。
# [EN] The **color icons** (bitmaps) for the eight start-menu items. User 2026-10-10: "Please draw or
# [EN] find online
# [EN] the kind of color icons from before; the current ones don't look good. If you find them online,
# [EN] avoid copyright issues."
# [EN] Assets = Microsoft Fluent Emoji (**MIT**, commercial use and redistribution allowed) → see
# [EN] `assets/images/menu_icons/README.md` (source, license, slot mapping, and how to rebuild are all
# [EN] there).
# [EN] Slot names (`<slot>.png` / `<slot>_dim.png`): open_book / books / play / puzzle /
# [EN] gear / brush / rewind / door. Generation script: `developers/make_menu_icons.py`.
MENU_ICON_DIR = APP_DIR / 'assets' / 'images' / 'menu_icons'


# ── 随附字体（可随程序分发，许可都允许）──────────────────────────────
# [EN] ── Bundled fonts (redistributable with the program; all licenses allow it) ──
#   ① **思源宋体 / Noto Serif SC**（SIL OFL 1.1）—— 2026-10-11 起是**默认**。
#      为什么换掉霞鹜文楷：它的底子是日文教科书体 Klee One，**部分汉字用的是
#      日文字形**。用户点名的那一个就是「门」：霞鹜文楷把第一笔的「点」写成了
#      一条斜长的撇（`developers/probe_glyph_men.py` 打出来的字符画看得很清楚），
#      而思源宋体、系统宋体、微软雅黑都是「一点 + 竖」的国标写法。
#      思源宋体同时满足"通用"（跨平台一致、字形合规）与"好看"（本程序的
#      水墨纸感与宋体是一路的）。
#   ② **思源黑体 / Noto Sans SC**（SIL OFL 1.1）—— 想换成现代无衬线时选它。
#   ③ **霞鹜文楷 / LXGW WenKai**（SIL OFL 1.1）—— 手写楷体，保留为可选项。
# [EN] ① **Source Han Serif / Noto Serif SC** (SIL OFL 1.1) -- has been the **default** since
# [EN] 2026-10-11.
# [EN] Why replace LXGW WenKai: its foundation is the Japanese textbook typeface Klee One, and **some
# [EN] kanji use
# [EN] Japanese glyph forms**. The one the user specifically called out is "门" (door): LXGW WenKai
# [EN] draws the first stroke's "dot" as
# [EN] a long slanted left-falling stroke (the character art printed by `developers/probe_glyph_men.py`
# [EN] shows this clearly),
# [EN] whereas Source Han Serif, the system Song typeface, and Microsoft YaHei all use the
# [EN] national-standard form of "one dot + vertical".
# [EN] Source Han Serif simultaneously satisfies "universal" (cross-platform consistency, glyph
# [EN] compliance) and "good-looking" (this program's
# [EN] ink-on-paper feel is in the same vein as Song typefaces).
# [EN] ② **Source Han Sans / Noto Sans SC** (SIL OFL 1.1) -- choose this when you want to switch to a
# [EN] modern sans-serif.
# [EN] ③ **LXGW WenKai** (SIL OFL 1.1) -- handwritten kai style, kept as an option.
# ⚠ **找不到字体文件时一律退回系统字体，绝不因为少一个 .ttf/.otf 就崩**。
# [EN] ① **Noto Serif SC** (SIL OFL 1.1) -- the **default** since 2026-10-11.
# [EN] Why LXGW WenKai was replaced: it is derived from Klee One, a Japanese schoolbook face, so
# [EN] **some Han characters use Japanese glyph forms**. The one the user named is 「门」: LXGW
# [EN] WenKai draws its first stroke (the dot) as a long slanted flick
# [EN] (`developers/probe_glyph_men.py` prints the ASCII art; it's plain to see), whereas Noto Serif
# [EN] SC, system SimSun and Microsoft YaHei all use the standard "dot + vertical" form.
# [EN] Noto Serif SC is both "universal" (consistent cross-platform, standard glyphs) and
# [EN] "good-looking" (a serif fits this program's ink-and-paper feel).
# [EN] ② **Noto Sans SC** (SIL OFL 1.1) -- pick this for a modern sans-serif.
# [EN] ③ **LXGW WenKai** (SIL OFL 1.1) -- handwritten Kai style, kept as an option.
# [EN] ⚠ **When a font file is missing, always fall back to a system font, never crash just
# [EN] because a .ttf/.otf is absent**.
BUNDLED_FONTS: dict = {
    # token: (Flet 族名, 文件名, 中文名, 英文名)
    # [EN] token: (Flet family name, filename, Chinese label, English label)
    'serif': ('NWS Noto Serif SC', 'NotoSerifSC-Regular.otf', '思源宋体', 'Noto Serif SC'),
    'sans': ('NWS Noto Sans SC', 'NotoSansSC-Regular.otf', '思源黑体', 'Noto Sans SC'),
    'kai': ('NWS LXGW WenKai', 'LXGWWenKai-Regular.ttf', '霞鹜文楷', 'LXGW WenKai'),
}

# ── 系统字体（**不随程序分发**，只在本机装了的时候才列出来）────────────
# [EN] ── System fonts (**not shipped with the program**; listed only when installed locally) ──
#   值里的族名就是 Flutter 认的那个名字。检测走 `available_system_fonts()`：
#   Windows 查 `C:/Windows/Fonts/` 的文件名，macOS 查字体目录，Linux 用 `fc-list`。
#   **认不出来就当没有** —— 宁可少列一项，也不给一个"选了不生效"的假选项。
# [EN] The family name in the value is exactly what Flutter recognizes. Detection goes through
# [EN] `available_system_fonts()`: Windows checks filenames under `C:/Windows/Fonts/`, macOS checks
# [EN] the font directories, Linux uses `fc-list`.
# [EN] **If it can't be identified, treat it as absent** -- better to list one item fewer than to
# [EN] offer a fake option that "does nothing when selected".
SYSTEM_FONTS: dict = {
    # token: (族名, 判存在用的文件名(小写), 中文名, 英文名)
    # [EN] token: (family name, filename used to detect presence (lowercase), Chinese label, English label)
    'yahei': ('Microsoft YaHei', 'msyh.ttc', '微软雅黑', 'Microsoft YaHei'),
    'simsun': ('SimSun', 'simsun.ttc', '宋体', 'SimSun'),
    'simhei': ('SimHei', 'simhei.ttf', '黑体', 'SimHei'),
    'kaiti': ('KaiTi', 'simkai.ttf', '楷体', 'KaiTi'),
    'dengxian': ('DengXian', 'deng.ttf', '等线', 'DengXian'),
    'pingfang': ('PingFang SC', 'pingfang.ttc', '苹方', 'PingFang SC'),
    'songti': ('Songti SC', 'songti.ttc', '宋体-简', 'Songti SC'),
    'noto-cjk': ('Noto Sans CJK SC', 'notosanscjk-regular.ttc', '思源黑体 CJK', 'Noto Sans CJK SC'),
}

#: 各平台的**系统默认**字体族（`UI_FONT=system` 用）。
#: ⚠ 这里给的是"这个系统上一定存在"的族名；Flet/Flutter 找不到时会自己回落到
#:   平台默认，所以即使某个族名对不上也不会变成方块字。
# [EN] : the **system default** font family per platform (used by `UI_FONT=system`).
# [EN] ⚠ These are family names that certainly exist on that system; if Flet/Flutter can't find
# [EN] one it falls back to the platform default itself, so even a mismatch won't become tofu boxes.
_PLATFORM_DEFAULT_FONT = {
    'win32': 'Microsoft YaHei',
    'darwin': 'PingFang SC',
    'linux': 'Noto Sans CJK SC',
}


def _sys_font_dirs() -> list:
    """系统字体目录（Windows / macOS / 常见 Linux 发行版各一份）。
        English:
    System font directories (one each for Windows / macOS / common Linux distros).
    """
    if sys.platform.startswith('win'):
        return [Path(os.environ.get('WINDIR', 'C:/Windows')) / 'Fonts']
    if sys.platform == 'darwin':
        return [Path('/System/Library/Fonts'), Path('/Library/Fonts'),
                Path.home() / 'Library' / 'Fonts']
    return [Path('/usr/share/fonts'), Path('/usr/local/share/fonts'),
            Path.home() / '.fonts', Path.home() / '.local' / 'share' / 'fonts']


def available_system_fonts() -> list:
    """本机**真的装了**的系统字体 token（按 `SYSTEM_FONTS` 里登记的判据查）。

    **认不出来就不列** —— 少列一项只是少一个选项，列了却不生效才是骗人
    （这个项目对"假旋钮"零容忍）。
    
        English:
    System font tokens **actually installed** on this machine (checked with the criteria registered
    in `SYSTEM_FONTS`).
        **If it can't be identified, don't list it** -- listing one fewer is just one option fewer;
        listing one that doesn't take effect is deceiving the user
        (this project has zero tolerance for "fake knobs").
    """
    found: set = set()
    try:
        for d in _sys_font_dirs():
            if not d.is_dir():
                continue
            names = {p.name.lower() for p in d.iterdir() if p.is_file()}
            for token, (_fam, probe, _zh, _en) in SYSTEM_FONTS.items():
                if probe in names:
                    found.add(token)
            # Flutter 认的是**族名**，而 Windows 上同一族名可能有多个文件；
            # 用文件名的口径与 `SYSTEM_FONTS` 对齐，别另起一套。
            # [EN] Flutter recognizes **family names**, and on Windows the same family may have
            # [EN] several files; keep the filename criterion aligned with `SYSTEM_FONTS`, don't
            # [EN] invent a second set.
    except OSError:
        return []
    if sys.platform.startswith('win'):
        # `SimSun` 的族名在 Flet 里是 "SimSun"（TTC 里的第一张脸）；
        # 有些机器上字体装在用户目录，`C:/Windows/Fonts` 里没有 —— 那就别列。
        # [EN] SimSun's family name in Flet is "SimSun" (the first face in the TTC); on some machines
        # [EN] fonts live in the user directory and aren't in `C:/Windows/Fonts` -- then don't list it.
        pass
    return [t for t in SYSTEM_FONTS if t in found]


def font_choices() -> list:
    """界面字体可选值：**只列本机真的能用的**（随附的看文件在不在，系统的看装没装）。

    返回 `[(token, 显示名)]`，顺序固定 —— 界面上不要出现"每次打开顺序都不一样"。
    
        English:
    Selectable UI font values: **only those actually usable on this machine** (bundled ones by file
    presence, system ones by installation).
        Returns `[(token, display name)]`, with a fixed order -- the UI must not show "a different
        order every time it opens".
    """
    out = [('auto', t('随附宋体（推荐）'))]
    for token in ('serif', 'sans', 'kai'):
        fam, fname, zh, en = BUNDLED_FONTS[token]
        if (FONT_DIR / fname).exists():
            out.append((token, t('随附{name}', name=t(zh))))
    out.append(('system', t('跟随系统')))
    for token in available_system_fonts():
        _fam, _probe, zh, en = SYSTEM_FONTS[token]
        out.append((token, t('系统 · {name}', name=t(zh))))
    return out


def bundled_font_files() -> dict:
    """随程序附带、且**真的在磁盘上**的字体 → `{族名: 路径}`（注册给 Flet）。

    值用**相对 `assets/` 的路径**（Flet 文档的写法："a relative path to a
    local asset"）—— 前提是 `ft.run(..., assets_dir=…)` 指到了 `assets/`
    （`start_gui()` 里显式给了绝对路径，不依赖"从哪启动"）。

    ★ 三份**全部注册**（不是只注册当前选中的那一份）：用户在「天机 · 界面外观」
      里换字体时要能立刻生效，而 `page.fonts` 是页面级的注册表 —— 缺一份就得
      重启才能切过去。
    
        English:
    Fonts bundled with the program and **actually on disk** -> `{family name: path}` (registered
    with Flet).
        Values use a **path relative to `assets/`** (as written in the Flet docs: "a relative path to a
        local asset") -- provided that `ft.run(..., assets_dir=...)` points to `assets/`
        (`start_gui()` explicitly gives an absolute path, not relying on "where it's launched from").
        ★ Register **all three** (not just the currently selected one): when the user switches fonts
        in "Tianji · UI appearance" it must take effect immediately, and `page.fonts` is a
        page-level registry -- missing one means a restart is needed to switch to it.
    """
    out = {}
    for token, (fam, fname, _zh, _en) in BUNDLED_FONTS.items():
        if (FONT_DIR / fname).exists():
            out[fam] = f'fonts/{fname}'
    return out


def resolve_ui_font(value: str = '') -> str:
    """把配置里的 token 翻成 Flet 认的**字体族名**（找不到就回落到平台默认）。

    这是"配置值 → 屏幕上真正的字体"的唯一入口 —— 别在别处再拼一遍，
    两处各拼一份就会出现"界面显示 A、实际用 B"。
    
        English:
    Translate the config token into the **font family name** Flet recognizes (falls back to the
    platform default when not found).
        This is the single entry point for "config value -> the font actually on screen" -- don't
        assemble it anywhere else, or two copies will produce "the UI shows A, the app uses B".
    """
    v = (value or '').strip()
    if v in ('', 'auto'):
        v = 'serif'
    if v in BUNDLED_FONTS:
        fam, fname, _zh, _en = BUNDLED_FONTS[v]
        return fam if (FONT_DIR / fname).exists() else _platform_default_font()
    if v == 'system':
        return _platform_default_font()
    if v in SYSTEM_FONTS:
        return SYSTEM_FONTS[v][0]
    # 认不出来的值（手改过 .env）→ 平台默认，别让界面变成方块
    # [EN] Unrecognized value (hand-edited .env) -> platform default, don't let the UI turn into tofu
    return _platform_default_font()


def _platform_default_font() -> str:
    """本平台一定有的系统字体族（兜底用）。
        English:
    A system font family that certainly exists on this platform (used as fallback).
    """
    key = 'linux'
    if sys.platform.startswith('win'):
        key = 'win32'
    elif sys.platform == 'darwin':
        key = 'darwin'
    return _PLATFORM_DEFAULT_FONT[key]


#: 界面/标题/正文统一用的字体族。
#: ★ 它现在由 `apply_font_settings()` 按 `CFG.s('UI_FONT')` 重算（不是导入时定死）——
#:   否则在「天机」里换了字体，得重启才会变。
# [EN] : the font family used uniformly for interface/title/body text.
# [EN] ★ It is now recomputed by `apply_font_settings()` from `CFG.s('UI_FONT')` (not fixed at import
# [EN] time) -- otherwise switching the font in "Tianji" would require a restart.
UI_FONT: str = resolve_ui_font(CFG.s('UI_FONT'))

# 「测试」「拉取模型列表」两个按钮的宽度。**它们要跟控件同一行**，
# 所以宽度是算出来的：行宽 = 标签 + 8 + 控件 + 8 + 按钮，必须正好等于 SET_W
# （本项目的老规矩：行宽恒等于传进去的 width，否则并排栅格就会超出去）。
# `BTN_TEST_W` 要给得住两个字（2×15=30px + 内边距 28 = 58），72 有余量；
# `BTN_PULL_W` 要住得下「拉取模型列表」六个字（6×15=90 + 28 = 118）——
# 112 会把最后那个字压掉，所以给 120，`SET_W` 那边相应少 128。
# [EN] The widths of the "测试" and "拉取模型列表" buttons. **They must be on the same row as the control**,
# [EN] so the widths are computed: row width = label + 8 + control + 8 + button, and must exactly equal
# [EN] SET_W
# [EN] (this project's old rule: row width always equals the width passed in, otherwise the
# [EN] side-by-side grid overflows).
# [EN] `BTN_TEST_W` must fit two characters (2×15=30px + padding 28 = 58), 72 has room to spare;
# [EN] 112 would squash the last character, so give it 120, and `SET_W` correspondingly loses 128.
BTN_TEST_W = 72
BTN_PULL_W = 120

# 开关 / 勾选 / 滑块的本体缩放（Flet 的 `scale`）。
# **别往小里调**：压到 0.70 时用户说"开关按钮又太小了"，翘回来到 0.90。
# 这三种控件的默认尺寸本来就偏大，0.85~0.95 是"和 24px 的输入框同量级"的区间。
# [EN] The body scale of switches / checkboxes / sliders (Flet's `scale`).
# [EN] **Don't tune it smaller**: when squashed to 0.70 the user said "the switch button is too small
# [EN] again", dialed back up to 0.90.
# [EN] These three controls' default sizes are on the large side to begin with; 0.85~0.95 is the range
# [EN] that is "the same magnitude as a 24px input box".
SWITCH_SCALE = 0.82
CHECK_SCALE = 0.82
SLIDER_SCALE = 0.86
# 单选钮（`mk_radio`）—— 与开关/勾选同一族（自带最小触控尺寸），
# 同样**不许给 height**，只缩 `scale`；0.82 落在上面那条区间里。
# [EN] Radio buttons (`mk_radio`) —— same family as switches/checkboxes (they have their own minimum
# [EN] touch size),
# [EN] likewise **not allowed to have height set**, only `scale`; 0.82 falls within the range above.
RADIO_SCALE = 0.82

# 对话框选项卡里的垂直节奏（「运行」「导演与合规」这些小节的排布）。
# 标题与选项挨太近 → 分不清"标题属于下面哪一组"（用户提过）。
SECTION_GAP = 10   # 小节标题**自身**的下边距（`mk_section` 用）
TAB_SPACING = 10   # 选项卡里相邻控件的间距（Column spacing）
# 选项卡条占掉的高度（**估的**，只用来算"内容区还剩多少"给滚动条一个初值；
# 真实高度靠用户滚动时的事件校正 —— 不做主动校准，理由见 `mk_scroll_bar`）。
# [EN] Titles and options too close together → can't tell "which group below the title belongs to" (the
# [EN] user mentioned this).
# [EN] The bottom margin of the section title **itself** (used by `mk_section`)
# [EN] The spacing between adjacent controls in a tab (Column spacing)
# [EN] The height the tab bar takes up (**an estimate**, only used to compute "how much content area is
# [EN] left" to give the scrollbar an initial value;
# [EN] the real height is corrected by events when the user scrolls —— no active calibration, see
# [EN] `mk_scroll_bar` for the reason).
TAB_BAR_H = 46

# 选项卡右侧给**滚动条**留的车道（px）。
# [EN] The lane reserved for the **scrollbar** on the right side of the tab (px).
# **滚动条画在「可滚动条（Column）」的右边缘上、并且是往左（往里）画的**，
# 所以车道的定义是「**视口右边缘 − 控件右边缘**」，它必须 ≥ 滚动条本体的宽度。
# [EN] **The scrollbar is drawn on the right edge of the "scrollable Column" and is drawn leftward
# [EN] (inward)**,
# [EN] so the lane is defined as "**viewport right edge − control right edge**", and it must be ≥ the
# [EN] scrollbar body's width.
# 这条路踩了两轮，记下来：
#   ① 一开始不留车道（Column 宽 = 控件宽 520）→ 滚动条整个压在输入框上；
#   ② 留 12 → 用户说"还是不对"。**因为 12 还是不够**：滚动条连轨道约 18~20px，
#      而且是往里画的，12px 的车道被吃光还倒欠几个像素。
#   ③ 现在 24：滚动条整个落在空车道上，离控件还余 5~6px。
# [EN] This path took two rounds, noting it down:
# [EN] ① At first no lane was reserved (Column width = control width 520) → the scrollbar lay entirely
# [EN] on top of the input box;
# [EN] ② reserving 12 → the user said "still not right". **Because 12 is still not enough**: the
# [EN] scrollbar including its track is about 18~20px,
# [EN] and it's drawn inward, so a 12px lane gets eaten up and is still short by a few pixels.
# [EN] ③ now 24: the scrollbar falls entirely on the empty lane, with 5~6px still left from the
# [EN] control.
# ⚠ 车道是**从对话框宽度里让出来的**，光调这个数会挤掉控件的宽度
# （控件是栅格定的 520，不能窄）→ **必须同步加宽 `DLG_W`**。
# 判据：`developers/measure_controls.py` 里有「车道 ≥ 24px」这条断言。
# [EN] ⚠ The lane is **yielded out of the dialog width**; just adjusting this number alone will squeeze
# [EN] the control's width
# [EN] (the control is grid-fixed at 520, cannot be narrower) → **`DLG_W` must be widened in sync**.
# [EN] Criterion: `developers/measure_controls.py` has the assertion "lane ≥ 24px".
TAB_GUTTER = 24

# 危险操作的按钮底色（朱砂）—— 删除这种不可逆的事，颜色必须跟旁边按钮分得开
# [EN] The background color of dangerous-operation buttons (cinnabar) —— for irreversible things like
# [EN] deletion, the color must be clearly distinguishable from neighboring buttons
DANGER = C['seal']

# 拾卷（存档列表）的几何。**滚动条画在可滚动控件的右边缘、并且往左画**
# （实测：连轨道 18~20px），所以列表里每一项都要比控件窄出一个车道，
# 否则滚动条会**压在最右边那条字上**。
# 现在用 `ft.ListView(padding=…)` 把车道做进内边距里 —— 项会自动占满
# 「控件宽 − 车道」，既满足"水平沾满"，又给滚动条留了位置。
SAVE_COL_W = 300      # 左栏（带边框那层容器）的总宽
SAVE_PAD = 8          # 容器内边距
SAVE_GUTTER = 22      # 滚动条车道
SAVE_CARD_FS = 12.5   # 存档卡片里摘要的字号（比正文小一号，卡片才不至于很高）
NOVEL_COL_W = 260     # ① 小说那一栏的宽（用户 2026-10-08：「让最左侧的小说标签稍微宽一些，
#                      把时间可以显示出来」—— 200 的时候「创建 2026-10-08 20:00」
#                      那一行会被省略号吃掉，只剩「创建 2026-10-0…」，看不出是哪天）
SAVE_DLG_W = 1160     # 拾卷三栏对话框的**内容**宽（外框还要再多 ~50）
#                       ↑ 1020 → 1160（用户 2026-10-08：「整个对话框 高和宽都调大一些」）；
#                         多出来的宽度都给了左右两栏，所以③详情那栏反而更宽了
SAVE_DLG_H = 660      # 三栏的高度（560 → 660，同上）
# 三栏清单的估高（栏杆头 + 内边距都扣掉）。只用来决定**初次**画不画那条
# 自绘滚动条 —— 真实位置/长度由滚动事件校正（见 `_scroll_bar`）。
# [EN] The geometry of 拾卷 (the save list). **The scrollbar is drawn on the right edge of the scrollable
# [EN] control, and drawn leftward**
# [EN] (measured: about 18~20px including the track), so every item in the list must be narrower than
# [EN] the control by one lane,
# [EN] otherwise the scrollbar will **press on the rightmost line of text**.
# [EN] Now `ft.ListView(padding=…)` is used to build the lane into the inner padding —— items
# [EN] automatically fill
# [EN] "control width − lane", satisfying both "horizontally flush" and leaving room for the scrollbar.
# [EN] Total width of the left column (the bordered container layer)
# [EN] Container inner padding
# [EN] Scrollbar lane
# [EN] The font size of the summary in the save card (one size smaller than body text, so the card
# [EN] isn't too tall)
# [EN] ① The width of the novel column (user 2026-10-08: "Make the leftmost novel label a bit wider,
# [EN] so the time can be displayed" —— at 200, "创建 2026-10-08 20:00"
# [EN] that line gets eaten by the ellipsis, leaving only "创建 2026-10-0…", so you can't tell which day
# [EN] it is)
# [EN] The **content** width of the three-column 拾卷 dialog (the outer frame needs about ~50 more)
# [EN] ↑ 1020 → 1160 (user 2026-10-08: "make the whole dialog both taller and wider");
# [EN] The extra width all went to the left and right columns, so the ③ detail column actually got
# [EN] wider
# [EN] Height of the three columns (560 → 660, same as above)
# [EN] Estimated height of the three-column list (bar header + inner padding both subtracted). Only
# [EN] used to decide whether to draw that line on the **initial** render
# [EN] custom-drawn scrollbar — real position/length is corrected by scroll events (see `_scroll_bar`).
SAVE_LIST_H = SAVE_DLG_H - 70

# 控件内边距（Flet Padding 顺序：left, top, right, bottom）
# 框高 24、正文 14 → 上下各留 2，字在里面仍是居中的。
# [EN] Control inner padding (Flet Padding order: left, top, right, bottom)
# [EN] Box height 24, body text 14 → 2 on top and bottom each, text stays vertically centered inside.
CP_FIELD = ft.Padding(10, 2, 10, 2)
CP_BTN = ft.Padding(14, 0, 14, 0)

# 对话框尺寸（**内层内容区**，宽×高）
# [EN] Dialog size (**inner content area**, width×height)
# 这些数字是**内层容器**的尺寸，不是屏幕上看到的对话框大小 —— 外面还套着
# `paper_frame` 的 padding/边框和 `AlertDialog` 自己的 content padding。
# 实测（`developers/measure_dialogs.py`）：
#     屏幕上的外框宽 = 这里给的宽 + 100
# 原来是 820，外框就是 920；而各对话框里最宽的控件只有 520
# （开卷向导的输入框曾是 580，已一并收到 520）—— 右边就白空了约 400px。
# 现在直接对齐控件宽度：**内层 = 控件宽 520 → 外框 620**，内容刚好填满，
# 剩下的只是必要的内边距，不再是"一片空白"。
# [EN] These numbers are the size of the **inner container**, not the dialog size seen on screen —
# [EN] outside it there's also
# [EN] `paper_frame`'s padding/border and `AlertDialog`'s own content padding.
# [EN] Measured (`developers/measure_dialogs.py`):
# [EN] on-screen outer frame width = the width given here + 100
# [EN] It used to be 820, so the outer frame was 920; yet the widest control in each dialog was only
# [EN] 520
# [EN] (the open-book wizard's input box used to be 580, now also reduced to 520) — so about 400px on
# [EN] the right was left blank.
# [EN] Now align directly to control width: **inner = control width 520 → outer frame 620**, content
# [EN] fills it exactly,
# [EN] what's left is only the necessary inner padding, no longer "a blank expanse".
# 高度按内容量分档。**每个对话框内容都带 scroll**，所以给矮了最坏只是滚动，
# 不会把内容裁掉。（注意 `mk_dialog` 里 body 带 `expand=True`，实测会把
# 对话框拉到接近满高 —— 高度这一档还要靠 measure_dialogs 复核。）
# 注意 `paper_frame` 自己还占掉 52px 横向内边距（内层 16×2 + 外层 7×2 + 边框 6）：
# 这里只写 520 的话，控件会把内边距顶掉、内容贴着纸边（实测内容 bbox 距边只剩 4px）。
# 所以宽度 = 控件宽 520 + 52 = 572 → 屏幕上的外框约 620，两侧各留 50px 内边距。
DLG_W = 600          # = 控件宽 520 + 滚动条车道 24 + 纸框内边距 56。
#: 「输入一个网址」那个小弹窗。宽度**与其他对话框一致**（整个软件只有一档宽度，
#: 看着才是一套）；高度**必须显式给** —— 见 `mk_dialog`：`ch` 是从 `content`
#: 身上读的，读不到就是 `None`，而里面那层 `expand=True` 会把它**拉到接近满屏**
#: （实测 1081px）。用户 2026-10-10 报的「网址对话框是不是太高了 但又太窄了」
#: 就是这个：我传了个裸 `Column(width=440)` —— 宽度自创、高度没给。
#: 内容只有「一句说明 + 一个输入框」，195 够（`tools/verify_dialog_sizes.py` 钉着）。
# [EN] Height is tiered by content volume. **Every dialog's content has scroll**, so giving it too
# [EN] little at worst means scrolling,
# [EN] not clipping the content. (Note that in `mk_dialog` the body has `expand=True`, which in
# [EN] practice
# [EN] stretches the dialog to nearly full height — this height tier still needs to be re-checked with
# [EN] measure_dialogs.)
# [EN] Note `paper_frame` itself also takes 52px of horizontal inner padding (inner 16×2 + outer 7×2 +
# [EN] border 6):
# [EN] if only 520 is written here, the control will push out the inner padding and the content will
# [EN] hug the paper edge (measured content bbox leaves only 4px to the edge).
# [EN] So width = control width 520 + 52 = 572 → about 620 outer frame on screen, 50px inner padding on
# [EN] each side.
# [EN] = control width 520 + scrollbar lane 24 + paper frame inner padding 56.
# [EN] : the small popup for "enter a URL". Its width is **consistent with other dialogs** (the whole
# [EN] app has only one width tier,
# [EN] : that's the only way it looks like one set); height **must be given explicitly** — see
# [EN] `mk_dialog`: `ch` is read from
# [EN] : `content`, and if it can't be read it's `None`, while the inner `expand=True` will **stretch
# [EN] it to nearly full screen**
# [EN] : (measured 1081px). This is exactly what the user reported on 2026-10-10 as "is the URL dialog
# [EN] too tall but also too narrow"
# [EN] : — I passed a bare `Column(width=440)` — width made up on the spot, height not given.
# [EN] : The content is only "one line of explanation + one input box", 195 is enough (pinned by
# [EN] `tools/verify_dialog_sizes.py`).
DLG_W_URL = DLG_W
DLG_H_URL = 195
#                        **车道是真实占用，不是白留**：`paper_frame` 的内边距（16×2）
#                        和 `mk_tab_content` 曾经的内边距（14+6）叠了两层，
#                        白白吃掉 20px；现在选项卡内容不再自带横向内边距
#                        （见 `mk_tab_content`），那 20px 挪去当车道。
#                        实测：DLG_W 576 → 屏幕外框 624、内容区 524（**比控件还窄**，
#                        滚动条因此压在输入框上）；现在 600 → 外框 648、车道 24。
DLG_H = 575          # 默认档：内容较多的（天机 / 书斋 / 启动故事）
#                         ↑ 520 → 575：选项卡里加了间距之后，宁可让对话框高一截，
#                           也别让内容硬挤在一起（用户明确要求）
DLG_H_WIZARD = 440   # 开卷向导：每步就两三个控件，撑满反而空
# ── 开卷向导：**每一步的内容宽** +「钉住的标题」─────────────────────────
#  用户 2026-10-11 连着报了两件（都在这一个对话框里）：
#    ① 「你又调整的太窄了 稍微加宽一些 **刚好贴着滚动条**就好了」——
#       上一轮为了"别压住滚动条"，把第 4 步的控件一概钉成 `SET_W`(520)，
#       于是右边**白白余出 68px**，看着就窄。真正的上限不是 520：
#       `DLG_W`(600) 里那 24px 车道**只有 4px 是条**，剩下的是纸框内边距 ——
#       内容可以让到「条的左边缘再往回退 6px」。
#    ② 「滚动条动的时候 **标题不能动** 标题下面的动才对」——
#       标题原来和正文一起躺在那个可滚的 `Column` 里 ⇒ 一滚就跟着跑掉。
#       现在由 `_wizard_body(head=…)` 钉在滚动区**外面**（下面那一层才滚）。
#  ⚠ 车道账写成**算式**（不抄一个数）：`SCROLL_BAR_W` 就是 `mk_scroll_bar` 里
#    那根 4px 细条的宽度，条在哪一侧也用同一个 `scroll_bar_right()` ——
#    将来谁改条宽，两者一起变，不会对不上。
# [EN] Open-book wizard: **each step's content width** + the "pinned title".
# [EN] The user reported two things in a row (both inside this one dialog, 2026-10-11):
# [EN] ① "you made it too narrow again, widen it a bit, **just touching the scrollbar**" --
# [EN] last round, to avoid "pressing the scrollbar", every control in step 4 was pinned to
# [EN] `SET_W` (520), which left **68px unused** on the right, so it looked narrow. The real ceiling
# [EN] is not 520: of those 24px in `DLG_W` (600), the lane holds a bar that is only 4px wide, the rest
# [EN] being paper-frame padding -- content may go up to "6px short of the bar's left edge".
# [EN] ② "when the scrollbar moves, the **title must not move**; what is below the title should" --
# [EN] the title used to sit inside that scrollable `Column` along with the body, so it ran off as soon
# [EN] as you scrolled. It is now pinned **outside** the scroll area by `_wizard_body(head=...)` (the
# [EN] layer below it is the one that scrolls).
# [EN] ⚠ The lane accounting is written as an **expression** (not copied as a number): `SCROLL_BAR_W`
# [EN] is exactly the width of that 4px thin bar in `mk_scroll_bar`, and its side comes from the same
# [EN] `scroll_bar_right()` -- whoever changes the bar width later changes both at once, so they cannot
# [EN] drift apart.
SCROLL_BAR_W = 4
#: 自绘细条与正文之间留出的呼吸（"刚好贴着"但不压字）。
# [EN] Breathing room between the self-drawn bar and the text ("just touching" without pressing).
SCROLL_BAR_EDGE = 6


def scroll_bar_right(lane: int) -> int:
    """自绘细条在车道里的**右偏移**（`mk_scroll_bar` 与向导宽度账共用这一处）。
        English:
    The **right offset** of the self-drawn thin bar inside its lane (shared by `mk_scroll_bar` and
    the wizard width accounting).
    """
    return max(2, (lane - SCROLL_BAR_W) // 2)


#: 开卷向导**每一步内容**可以用到的宽度：`DLG_W` 去掉条占的那一条，再让出呼吸。
#: = 600 − (10 + 4) − 6 = **580**（上一轮是 520，用户就报"太窄"）。
# [EN] The width **every wizard step's content** may use: `DLG_W` minus what the bar occupies, minus
# [EN] the breathing room. = 600 − (10 + 4) − 6 = **580** (it was 520 last round, and the user called
# [EN] that "too narrow").
WIZ_W = DLG_W - (scroll_bar_right(TAB_GUTTER) + SCROLL_BAR_W) - SCROLL_BAR_EDGE
#: 钉住的标题与滚动区之间的间距。
# [EN] Spacing between the pinned title and the scroll area.
WIZ_HEAD_GAP = 6
#: 标题那一条的**估**高（只用来给条一个初始长度，真实长度由滚动事件校正）。
# [EN] The **estimated** height of the title strip (only used for the bar's initial length; the real
# [EN] length is corrected by scroll events).
WIZ_HEAD_H = 44
# ── 「天机 · 全局设置」**专用**的宽度（比 `DLG_W` 宽一档）──────────────────
# [EN] **The lane is genuinely occupied, not left blank**: `paper_frame`'s inner padding (16×2)
# [EN] and `mk_tab_content`'s former inner padding (14+6) stacked two layers,
# [EN] wasting 20px for nothing; now tab content no longer carries its own horizontal inner padding
# [EN] (see `mk_tab_content`), and that 20px is moved to serve as the lane.
# [EN] Measured: DLG_W 576 → on-screen outer frame 624, content area 524 (**narrower than the
# [EN] controls**,
# [EN] so the scrollbar pressed onto the input box); now 600 → outer frame 648, lane 24.
# [EN] ↑ 520 → 575: after adding spacing in the tabs, rather let the dialog be a bit taller,
# [EN] than let content be crammed together (explicit user request)
# [EN] Open-book wizard: only two or three controls per step, filling it up would just be empty
# 为什么只有它要更宽（2026-10-10 用户报的）：
#   「天机（全局设置 左右再大一些 最右侧 Tab 看不见了）」。
#   它的页签是**六个、而且名字长**（「推演服务LLM设定」「创作服务LLM设定」
#   各 8 个字），600 的宽度装不下 —— Flet 1.0 的 `TabBar.scrollable`
#   **默认是 True**（与 Flutter 的默认值相反），于是装不下的页签不是换行、
#   也不是截断，而是**被推到可视区之外**：用户看到的就是"右边少一个页签"。
#   所以两手都要：① 这里加宽；② 把 `scrollable` 显式关掉（见 `show_global_settings`），
#   让它**必须**把所有页签摆进来。
# [EN] Why only it needs to be wider (reported by user 2026-10-10):
# [EN] "天机 (global settings, make left/right bigger, the rightmost Tab is invisible)".
# [EN] 8 characters each), so width 600 can't fit them — Flet 1.0's `TabBar.scrollable`
# [EN] **defaults to True** (opposite of Flutter's default), so tabs that don't fit are not wrapped,
# [EN] nor truncated, but **pushed outside the visible area**: what the user sees is "one tab missing
# [EN] on the right".
# [EN] So both hands are needed: ① widen here; ② explicitly turn off `scrollable` (see
# [EN] `show_global_settings`),
# [EN] so it **must** fit all tabs in.
# ★ 宽的这 140px **不是白留**：选项卡内容车道同步加宽（`TAB_LANE_EXTRA`），
#   控件在车道里**居中**，滚动条照旧贴右边缘 —— 于是"对话框变宽"不会变成
#   "右边空出一大片纸"。见 `mk_tab_content(lane_extra=...)`。
TAB_LANE_EXTRA = 140     # 天机页签内容车道比常规宽出来的那部分
# ↑ 2026-10-11：加了「剧组 Agents」页之后重算过（`tools/verify_tabs_fit.py`），
#   7 个页签在 684 宽里仍放得下，这个值不用动。
# [EN] ★ This extra 140px **is not left blank**: the tab content lane is widened in sync
# [EN] (`TAB_LANE_EXTRA`),
# [EN] controls are **centered** in the lane, and the scrollbar still hugs the right edge — so "dialog
# [EN] widened" won't turn into
# [EN] "a big blank stretch of paper on the right". See `mk_tab_content(lane_extra=...)`.
# [EN] The part by which the 天机 tab content lane is wider than the regular one
# [EN] ↑ 2026-10-11: recalculated after adding the "剧组 Agents" page (`tools/verify_tabs_fit.py`),
# [EN] 7 tabs still fit in width 684, so this value doesn't need to change.
DLG_W_TABS = SET_W + TAB_GUTTER + TAB_LANE_EXTRA    # = 684
DLG_H_LIST = 480     # 拾卷：项目列表，长了靠滚动
DLG_H_EXPORT = 500   # 导出：勾选项 + 分组标题 + 结果区，比默认略矮
# 「还没配 LLM」那个引导框（2026-10-06）：三段话 + 一行出处，比向导还短。
# ⚠ **必须显式给高度**：`mk_dialog` 是从 `content` 身上读尺寸的，不给就把
#   对话框拉到近满屏高（实测每个都 1081px，内容少的看着很怪）。
# [EN] 拾卷: project list, scrolls when long
# [EN] 导出: checkboxes + group titles + result area, slightly shorter than default
# [EN] The "no LLM configured yet" guide box (2026-10-06): three paragraphs + one line of source, even
# [EN] shorter than the wizard.
# [EN] ⚠ **Height must be given explicitly**: `mk_dialog` reads size from `content`, and if not given
# [EN] it stretches
