#   ⚠ 宽度也放大：日志行是「时刻 · 模块 · 级别 · 消息」四段并排，
#     窄了消息那一段只剩十几个字。
# [EN] Log viewer dialog (user requested on 2026-10-08 "a new dialog (larger)"):
# [EN] It must fit 4 rows of controls + a screen of 200 log entries, so it's wider and taller than a
# [EN] normal dialog.
# [EN] ⚠ Width is also enlarged: a log line is four segments side by side "time · module · level ·
# [EN] message",
# [EN] if too narrow the message segment only has a dozen or so characters left.
LOG_DLG_W = 1000
